repository-code: https://github.com/adgjl7777777/hygel_martini
abstract: >-
  Research software for graph-first construction and router-independent
  topology auditing of prescribed periodic coarse-grained Martini hydrogel
  networks, with simulation preparation and analysis tools. The package also
  contains separate force-field parameterization workflows that are outside
  the scope of the builder paper.
